    <string name="events_simulator_guide_title">Attention test guide</string>
    <string name="events_simulator_guide_body">Reset lab → choose Rotation or Random → Next expectation → open Events. The popup names the scenario, seed, target position, preferred placement, queue counts, and expected button results. Rotation cycles top, middle, bottom, then blocking-freeze. Random is seeded and replayable. If the stated next state does not happen, that is a bug.</string>
